/**
 * Internationalization (Indonesian / English).
 *
 * Static text is translated via `data-i18n="key"` attributes in the
 * PHP views (applyTranslations() replaces their textContent). Dynamic
 * text generated by sensor.js/weather.js calls t(key) directly.
 *
 * Default language is Indonesian ("id") — matches the original
 * project's audience and most of its existing copy.
 */

